{
  "id": "p50",
  "title": "The Winning Shot",
  "titleZh": "获奖照片",
  "topic": "市政厅摄影比赛与争议照片",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "The town hall show has a firm base in local character.",
        "zh": "市政厅的展览扎根于本地的性格。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Entries show various styles and a bold new camera technique.",
        "zh": "参赛作品展示了各种风格和一种大胆的新摄影技术。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Hundreds attend the show at the old city art institute.",
        "zh": "数百人参加了在老城市艺术学院举办的展览。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The strength of each photo lies in its quiet battle.",
        "zh": "每张照片的力量都在于它安静的斗争。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A short piece of writing draws a huge mass of visitors.",
        "zh": "一篇短文吸引了大量参观者。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The judges defend the choice in a special edition.",
        "zh": "评委在一期特刊中为这个选择辩护。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My own analysis is practical and easy to follow.",
        "zh": "我自己的分析实用且容易跟上。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A long sheet of handwritten notes hangs in the quiet gallery.",
        "zh": "一张写满手写笔记的长纸挂在安静的画廊里。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then one photo shows a rusted tank and a badly worn fence.",
        "zh": "然后一张照片显示一个生锈的储罐和一道严重破损的围栏。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Another frames the old port zone at the first soft light.",
        "zh": "另一张在第一缕柔光中框住了旧港口区。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "The photographer had permission and seemed altogether calm.",
        "zh": "摄影师获得了许可，看起来完全平静。"
      },
      {
        "en": "An announcement names a small crop field as the winning shot.",
        "zh": "一项公告把一片小农田命名为获奖作品。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Local folk enjoy the humour and bite of every entry.",
        "zh": "本地人喜欢每个参赛作品中的幽默与尖锐。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A mild reply at the front counter ends the first complaint.",
        "zh": "前台的温和回复结束了第一起投诉。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My aunt says a boom in visitors lifts the cafe's fare.",
        "zh": "我姑姑说游客的激增提升了咖啡馆的饭菜。"
      },
      {
        "en": "One picture shows spray on a field, particularly at dawn.",
        "zh": "一张照片显示田野上的喷洒，尤其是在黎明。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The winning image gives the young photographer real confidence.",
        "zh": "获奖图像给了年轻摄影师真正的信心。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Some older viewers recall a federal report from that year.",
        "zh": "一些年长的观众回忆起那一年的联邦报告。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My cousin's employer takes the complaint seriously at once.",
        "zh": "我表姐的雇主立刻严肃对待这起投诉。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The judges put emphasis on beauty and try to justify it.",
        "zh": "评委强调美，并试图为此辩护。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "Later a quiet resistance grows against the old formula.",
        "zh": "后来一种安静的反抗针对旧的公式生长。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A proof of the date stirs a long public debate.",
        "zh": "一个日期的证据激起了一场漫长的公开辩论。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The mayor gives a clear hint of a second public review.",
        "zh": "市长明确暗示会有第二次公开审查。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Some say the whole contest was a deliberate political act.",
        "zh": "有人说整场比赛是一场蓄意的政治行为。"
      },
      {
        "en": "One lens caught the face of the old regime.",
        "zh": "一只镜头捕捉到了旧政权的面孔。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The council concedes a dividend for the arts fund.",
        "zh": "议会为艺术基金让出一笔红利。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later no one will prosecute, and apparently the show stays.",
        "zh": "后来没有人会起诉，显然展览留了下来。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Finally, with the ninetieth banner done, the coloured show ends.",
        "zh": "最后，随着第九十面横幅完成，彩色的展览结束了。"
      }
    ]
  ],
